{"name":"Kavach (कवच)","short_name":"Kavach","description":"Kavach is a general-purpose, compiled, statically typed programming language. Every function says what it may touch (files, network, AI, payments), and the compiler checks it.","start_url":"/","display":"browser","background_color":"#1C1917","theme_color":"#1C1917","icons":[{"src":"/icon.svg","sizes":"any","type":"image/svg+xml"},{"src":"/logo.png","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png"}]}